# a first look and listen: the starting set, eight bars of it, the phrase's last bar counting in
# (G_: 0 Tempo 1 Swing 2 Loose 3 Max hits 4 Chaos 5 Motion 6 Reverb 7 Delay 8 Filter 9 Drive 10 Level 11 MIDI ch
#  T_: 0 Bars 1 Rnd len 2 Hits min 3 Hits max 4 Pitch 5 Evolve 6 Kind 7 Mute 8 Deviance 9 Length 10 Edge 11 Ring
#  12 Ring tone 13 Level)
wait 300
shot home.png
expect playing 0
expect view 0
expect track 0
expect kind0 0
expect kind1 1
expect kind2 2
expect kind3 3
expect len 32
expect hits >2
expect phrase -1
leds
wav first.wav
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 1000
shot playing.png
leds
expect voices >0
# into the eighth bar (112 BPM: a bar is 2143 ms; bar 8 starts at 15000)
wait 14300
shot bar8_beat1.png
expect phrase >111
wait 1100
shot bar8_beat3.png
leds
wait 900
expect phrase <16
shot round2.png
wait 2000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.1
expect peak_db_min -24
expect dropped 0
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
